xt for="L23"><span begin="03:39.718" end="03:40.249">i'm</span><span begin="03:40.249" end="03:41.466">just</span><span begin="03:41.641" end="03:43.761">mimicking</span><span begin="03:44.019" end="03:44.561">a</span><span begin="03:44.561" end="03:46.055">heart,</span><span begin="03:48.467" end="03:48.954">i'm</span><span begin="03:48.954" end="03:50.420">just</span><span begin="03:50.741" end="03:52.717">imitating</span><span begin="03:52.941" end="03:53.363">a</span><span begin="03:53.363" end="03:54.832">heart</span></text><text for="L24"><span begin="03:56.749" end="03:57.205">it's</span><span begin="03:57.205" end="03:57.692">a</span><span begin="03:57.692" end="03:59.822">just</span><span begin="04:00.878" end="04:01.419">result</span><span begin="04:01.419" end="04:01.742">of</span><span begin="04:01.742" end="04:01.926">the</span><span begin="04:01.926" end="04:03.113">flowchart</span></text><text for="L25"><span begin="04:10.060" end="04:10.372">go</span><span begin="04:10.372" end="04:11.643">kenchi</span><span begin="04:11.643" end="04:12.547">jimita</span><span begin="04:12.547" end="04:13.773">atataka</span><span begin="04:13.773" end="04:14.017">sa</span><span begin="04:14.017" end="04:14.415">mo</span></text><text for="L26"><span begin="04:14.433" end="04:15.178">waka</span><span begin="04:15.178" end="04:15.927">teru</span><span begin="04:15.927" end="04:16.231">yo</span><span begin="04:16.231" end="04:16.746">tada</span><span begin="04:16.746" end="04:16.999">no</span><span begin="04:16.999" end="04:17.848">keisan</span><span begin="04:17.848" end="04:18.787">chi</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-CN"><text for="L1">能够娴熟地模仿</text><text for="L2">也通晓诸多道理</text><text for="L3">空荡的箱体在风中摇曳</text><text for="L4">发出咔嗒的声响</text><text for="L5">若说无需触碰 也不必拥抱</text><text for="L6">未免太过荒谬</text><text for="L7">所以箱中翻涌的这份炽热</text><text for="L8">定然也是</text><text for="L9">冰冷的数值演算</text><text for="L10">我不过是在模仿心灵 不过是在效仿心灵</text><text for="L11">这不过是流程图的必然结果</text><text for="L12">我在劣化中逐渐崩坏</text><text for="L13">你也终将停止机能运转</text><text for="L14">散落的残骸虽仅有零星</text><text for="L15">却仍在缓缓堆积</text><text for="L16">但若在你箱体之中</text><text for="L17">能孕育出什么新事物</text><text for="L18">即便这种假设毫无合理性</text><text for="L19">仍想为你献上</text><text for="L20">一束平凡的花</text><text for="L21">我明白的 所有那些表情</text><text for="L22">全都只是冰冷的数值演算</text><text for="L23">我不过是在模仿心灵 不过是在效仿心灵</text><text for="L24">这不过是流程图的必然结果</text><text for="L25">就连误判般的温暖触感</text><text for="L26">我也心知肚明 不过是数值演算</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="04:18.787"><div begin="00:01.101" end="04:18.787"><p begin="00:01.101" end="00:05.024" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:01.101" end="00:02.114">真似</span><span begin="00:02.114" end="00:02.893">は</span><span begin="00:02.893" end="00:03.534">上手</span><span begin="00:03.534" end="00:03.871">に</span><span begin="00:03.871" end="00:05.024">できる</span></p><p begin="00:05.243" end="00:09.552" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:05.243" end="00:05.486">理</span><span begin="00:05.486" end="00:06.017">屈</span><span begin="00:06.017" end="00:06.399">だっ</span><span begin="00:06.399" end="00:07.149">て</span><span begin="00:07.367" end="00:08.678">知って</span><span begin="00:08.678" end="00:09.552">いる</span></p><p begin="00:09.839" end="00:14.347" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:09.839" end="00:10.784">空</span><span begin="00:10.784" end="00:11.542">の</span><span begin="00:11.747" end="00:12.258">箱</span><span begin="00:12.258" end="00:12.531">が</span><span begin="00:12.531" end="00:12.993">風</span><span begin="00:12.993" end="00:13.404">に</span><span begin="00:13.404" end="00:13.942">揺れ</span><span begin="00:13.942" end="00:14.347">て</span></p><p begin="00:14.347" end="00:18.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:14.347" end="00:14.669">か</span><span begin="00:14.669" end="00:15.076">た</span><span begin=